    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109050/extras/cbfc590f0d771e8cfdfc255bb50fb5fa.poster.avif?t=1755012324\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109050/extras/cbfc590f0d771e8cfdfc255bb50fb5fa.webm?t=1755012324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109050/extras/cbfc590f0d771e8cfdfc255bb50fb5fa.mp4?t=1755012324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The opportunity to jump quickly\u2026\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7000 waifus waiting for marriage\u2026\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commander\u3001survey the \u300cWilderness\u300d for grass blessings\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010About Waifu\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcWhat is an Waifu?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a special collectible character with tailored attributes\u3002Waifu is a staple around the world\u3002 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109050/extras/746985977abeaadd702a5ecdf65563ea.poster.avif?t=1755012324\" width=250 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109050/extras/746985977abeaadd702a5ecdf65563ea.webm?t=1755012324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109050/extras/746985977abeaadd702a5ecdf65563ea.mp4?t=1755012324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Gameplay\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire arrows with left-click\u3001collect meat with right-click\u3002Your prize will be automatically delivered to your inventory as you collect and stack meats\u3002 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Rarity\u3011</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique - 76%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal - 14%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 - 10%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SSR - 0.01%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contraband - 1/1,000,000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Notes\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After adjusting the distribution status values\u3001various reflection values \u200b\u200bare balanced and the status values \u200b\u200bare significantly improved\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bClaim up to 8\u300cWaifu Crystal\u300devery 24 hours\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300cThe Harem Realm\uff5eWAIFU\uff5e\u300d Dear Operation Team</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109050/extras/cbfc590f0d771e8cfdfc255bb50fb5fa.poster.avif?t=1755012324\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109050/extras/cbfc590f0d771e8cfdfc255bb50fb5fa.webm?t=1755012324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109050/extras/cbfc590f0d771e8cfdfc255bb50fb5fa.mp4?t=1755012324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The opportunity to jump quickly\u2026\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7000 waifus waiting for marriage\u2026\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commander\u3001survey the \u300cWilderness\u300d for grass blessings\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010About Waifu\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25bcWhat is an Waifu?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a special collectible character with tailored attributes\u3002Waifu is a staple around the world\u3002 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109050/extras/746985977abeaadd702a5ecdf65563ea.poster.avif?t=1755012324\" width=250 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109050/extras/746985977abeaadd702a5ecdf65563ea.webm?t=1755012324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3109050/extras/746985977abeaadd702a5ecdf65563ea.mp4?t=1755012324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Gameplay\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire arrows with left-click\u3001collect meat with right-click\u3002Your prize will be automatically delivered to your inventory as you collect and stack meats\u3002 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Rarity\u3011</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique - 76%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal - 14%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 - 10%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SSR - 0.01%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contraband - 1/1,000,000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Notes\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After adjusting the distribution status values\u3001various reflection values \u200b\u200bare balanced and the status values \u200b\u200bare significantly improved\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bClaim up to 8\u300cWaifu Crystal\u300devery 24 hours\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300cThe Harem Realm\uff5eWAIFU\uff5e\u300d Dear Operation Team</p>",
